The affected-reference scan filters against the old catalog, so adding a formerly unknown model never validates its persisted references. An incompatible addition succeeds and is persisted, but RuntimePolicy validates that reference on restart and throws, preventing daemon startup. Reproduced with `bun "$TMPDIR/review-retired-restoration.ts"`. Output after the initial retired-reference warning:
